{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n何依婷與容天佑在TVB節目《三代同糖》中飾演情侶，火花四濺，獲網民大讚非常合襯！近日何依婷接受訪問時，竟大方透露與容天佑早已認識，更出席過對方婚禮，直言因為認識他太太，所以在拍攝感情戲時反而更有幫助，究竟背後原因是甚麼？\n</p>\n<h2>網民激讚何依婷容天佑好合襯 擔心太快玩完</h2>\n<p>何依婷與容天佑在劇中組成的「霸道總裁與拜金公關」CP，成功吸引大批觀眾眼球。不少網民湧入討論區留言，大讚二人外型登對，化學作用十足：「靚仔靚女好襯」、「終於有霸道總裁治到圓嬤嬤」。不過，由於兩人的感情線發展迅速，亦有忠實觀眾表示擔心，怕劇情太快會讓他們分手收場：「但佢哋咁快喺埋一齊，會唔會好快 GG（玩完）？」可見這對CP已成功引起觀眾的投入與關注。</p>\n<h2>何依婷親解默契來源：我認識佢太太</h2>\n<p>對於螢幕情侶形象大受歡迎，何依婷接受tvb.com訪問時，親自解開了與容天佑默契十足的秘密。她透露兩人其實認識多年，因為早已熟絡，所以拍感情戲完全沒有隔閡。她更驚喜自爆：「我之前有去佢嘅婚禮，亦都認識佢太太。所以大家喺好熟悉，完全唔陌生嘅情況下拍感情戲，對投入角色非常有幫助，可以好快進入狀態。」大方坦誠的態度，讓觀眾更了解他們專業的一面。</p>\n<h2>二人繼《法言人》再合作 朋友昇華做情侶</h2>\n<p>何依婷與容天佑的緣份，原來始於TVB節目《法言人》。當時二人在劇中飾演朋友，已有不少對手戲，建立了良好合作基礎。這次在《三代同糖》中再度合作，關係由朋友「昇華」為情侶，默契自然更上一層樓。正因為有過去的合作經驗，加上私下的友誼，讓他們在演繹情侶間的甜蜜互動時，顯得更加自然流暢，成功說服觀眾投入劇情。</p>\n<h2>粉絲洗版力撐：呢對CP我鎖死！</h2>\n<p>對於何依婷大方分享與容天佑的幕後關係，網民反應相當正面，紛紛留言力撐。有網民表示：「難怪佢哋啲互動咁自然，原來本身就熟！」亦有人大讚何依婷專業：「識人老婆都唔會尷尬，仲可以投入角色，好Pro！」更有粉絲已經完全投入劇情：「呢對CP我鎖死咗，唔可以GG呀！」有觀眾亦留言：「靚仔靚女好襯，希望之後有多啲糖食！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_3849213726aeabe85f0ff0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_3849213726aeabe85f0ff0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_9197639106aeabe8beca66.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_9197639106aeabe8beca66.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_7739915736aeabe95ceb5b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_7739915736aeabe95ceb5b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_16258351126aeabe9fda903.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_16258351126aeabe9fda903.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20702274016aeabea54e800.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20702274016aeabea54e800.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:38.874581+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1107,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:52.264288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:47.941741+00:00","content_hash":"0b3f8acf63dabb750d0b2fbb7f2ccabfe2d367e425a1717f2259fb42935c2cce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}